{
  "schemaVersion": "flowhub.bindings/v1",
  "description": "MOCK ONLY：合成绑定目录。共享数据库 MCP 的两份绑定复用相同模拟 endpoint/实现，但 credentialRef、connectionId、environment 彼此独立。不得直接替换 URL/密钥后把模拟验证当作生产验证。可用 workflow.schema.json 中 $defs.bindingCatalog 对本文件作结构校验。",
  "simulationOnly": true,
  "bindings": [
    {
      "bindingRef": "aliyun-log-prod",
      "displayName": "阿里云生产日志（模拟）",
      "environment": "production",
      "validationStatus": "MOCK_VERIFIED",
      "simulationOnly": true,
      "realExecutionAllowed": false,
      "transport": "streamable_http",
      "endpoint": "https://aliyun-log.example.invalid/mcp",
      "endpointAllowlist": [
        "aliyun-log.example.invalid"
      ],
      "serverImplementationRef": "mock-aliyun-log",
      "protocolEra": "legacy",
      "credentialRef": "secret://demo/aliyun-log-prod",
      "allowedTools": [
        "aliyun_log_search"
      ],
      "lockedArguments": {
        "/environment": "production",
        "/project": "DEMO-LOG-PROD"
      },
      "allowedQueryTemplates": [],
      "environmentEnforcement": "MOCK_ADAPTER_ONLY",
      "readOnlyEnforcement": "MOCK_ADAPTER_ONLY",
      "maxRows": 200,
      "timeoutSeconds": 30,
      "notes": "仅用于合成 fixture。example.invalid 不代表可连接服务；secret://demo 引用不含实际凭证。Mock 应使用受控内存/回环 transport 替身，不能向该地址发起生产调用。MOCK_VERIFIED 不等于真实端点、只读权限或环境隔离已经核验。生产发布仍需独立的 BINDING_VERIFIED 证据及人工批准。"
